<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>Blueprint Value Map – Portfolio</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0d1b2a; --blue: #1b4f72; --mid: #2471a3;
    --accent: #1abc9c; --accent2: #f39c12;
    --light: #eaf2fb; --text: #1a1a2e; --muted: #5d6d7e;
    --white: #ffffff; --card-bg: #ffffff; --border: #d5e8f5;
    --tag-tech: #2e86c1; --tag-finance: #1a5276; --tag-retail: #6c3483;
    --tag-health: #1a7a4b; --tag-energy: #784212; --tag-gov: #555555;
    --tag-food: #7d6608; --tag-dist: #1b6ca8; --tag-generic: #2e4057;
    --section-bg: #f4f8fb;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: var(--section-bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* HERO */
  .hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--blue) 60%, var(--mid) 100%); color: white; padding: 70px 40px 60px; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='60' height='60' viewBox='0 0 60 60' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd'%3E%3Cg fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='0.04'%3E%3Cpath d='M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E"); pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-tag { display: inline-block; background: rgba(26,188,156,0.25); color: #1abc9c; border: 1px solid rgba(26,188,156,0.5); border-radius: 20px; padding: 4px 16px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.15; }
  .hero h1 span { color: #1abc9c; }
  .hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; opacity: 0.85; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 36px; }
  .stats-row { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 40px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 40px; }
  .stat { text-align: center; }
  .stat-num { font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 900; color: #1abc9c; line-height: 1; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-top: 4px; }

  /* FRAMEWORK EXPLAINER */
  .explainer { background: white; border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent); }
  .explainer-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
  .explainer-text h2 { font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .explainer-text h2 span { color: var(--mid); }
  .explainer-text p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
  .pillar { background: var(--light); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; }
  .pillar strong { display: block; color: var(--navy); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .pillar span { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .explainer-img img { width: 100%; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border: 1px solid var(--border); cursor: zoom-in; }

  /* SECTIONS */
  .section { max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 32px; }
  .section-header { margin-bottom: 36px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 20px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 20px; }
  .section-icon { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .section-header h2 { font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.2; }
  .section-header p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }
  .section-count { margin-left: auto; background: var(--navy); color: white; border-radius: 20px; padding: 4px 14px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }

  /* CARDS */
  .card-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(310px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
  .card-grid.wide { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(380px, 1fr)); }
  .card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); border: 1px solid var(--border); transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.13); }
  .card-img { width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; object-position: top left; cursor: zoom-in; display: block; background: #f0f4f8; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); transition: transform 0.3s; }
  .card:hover .card-img { transform: scale(1.03); }
  .card-img-wrap { overflow: hidden; }
  .card-body { padding: 18px 20px 20px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .card-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: white; border-radius: 4px; padding: 3px 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; width: fit-content; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .card p { font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.55; flex: 1; }
  .card-meta { margin-top: 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .meta-chip { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--mid); background: var(--light); border-radius: 20px; padding: 3px 10px; font-weight: 600; }

  /* SPOTLIGHT */
  .spotlight { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0%, var(--blue) 100%); padding: 56px 32px; }
  .spotlight-inner { max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .spotlight h2 { color: white; font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .spotlight > .spotlight-inner > p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .suite-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 24px; }
  .suite-main .card-img { height: 280px; }
  .suite-variations { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .suite-variations .card-img { height: 140px; }

  /* VARIATIONS */
  .variations-section { background: white; padding: 60px 32px; }
  .variations-inner { max-width: 1300px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .variations-inner h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .variations-inner > p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 0.97rem; max-width: 750px; }
  .var-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .var-card { border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; background: var(--light); }
  .var-num { width: 34px; height: 34px; background: var(--navy); color: white; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .var-card h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--navy); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .var-card p { font-size: 0.83rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.5; }
  .var-examples { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--mid); font-weight: 600; }

  footer { background: var(--navy); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-align: center; padding: 30px; font-size: 0.83rem; }

  /* MODAL */
  .modal-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92); z-index: 1000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }
  .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }
  .modal-overlay img { max-width: 96vw; max-height: 92vh; border-radius: 6px; object-fit: contain; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }
  .modal-close { position: fixed; top: 16px; right: 20px; color: white; font-size: 2rem; cursor: pointer; background: none; border: none; z-index: 1001; line-height: 1; }
  .modal-caption { position: fixed; bottom: 16px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7); color: white; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .modal-loading { position: fixed; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%,-50%); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 0.9rem; pointer-events: none; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .explainer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }
    .suite-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .suite-variations { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stats-row { gap: 24px; }
    .hero { padding: 50px 20px 40px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- MODAL -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal" onclick="closeModal(event)">
  <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal(event)">&#215;</button>
  <div class="modal-loading" id="modal-loading">Loading full resolution…</div>
  <img id="modal-img" src="" alt="" style="display:none;">
  <div class="modal-caption" id="modal-cap"></div>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-tag">Portfolio Overview</div>
  <h1>The <span>Blueprint</span> Value Map</h1>
  <p>A strategic framework that maps every process, metric, and data flow across an organization — connecting corporate goals to frontline execution and aligning business outcomes to Enterprise Performance Management (EPM) use-cases. This portfolio showcases real-world deployments across industries, company sizes, and use cases.</p>
  <div class="stats-row">
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">60+</div><div class="stat-label">Blueprints Delivered</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">9</div><div class="stat-label">Industries</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">7</div><div class="stat-label">Variation Types</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">∞</div><div class="stat-label">Configurations</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FRAMEWORK EXPLAINER -->
<div class="explainer">
  <div class="explainer-inner">
    <div class="explainer-text">
      <h2>What Is the <span>Blueprint Value Map?</span></h2>
      <p>The Blueprint is a structured visual framework that captures the full planning landscape of an organization — from strategic goals down to tactical metrics — organized by business function. It serves as a living operating system for connected planning.</p>
      <p>Every blueprint shares the same foundational anatomy: columns represent business functions (Sales, Marketing, Operations, Finance, HR, IT, etc.), while rows represent planning horizons (Strategic, Operational, Tactical). Corporate goals sit at the top, driving alignment down through the entire organization.</p>
      <p>The key insight: <strong>data flows bidirectionally</strong> — a change upstream ripples downstream, and a metric shift at the tactical level surfaces strategically. The Blueprint makes this invisible architecture visible.</p>
      <div class="pillars">
        <div class="pillar"><strong>Business Functions</strong><span>Columns organized by department or domain</span></div>
        <div class="pillar"><strong>Planning Horizons</strong><span>Strategic → Operational → Tactical rows</span></div>
        <div class="pillar"><strong>Corporate Goals</strong><span>Revenue, EPS, cost, culture — anchored at top</span></div>
        <div class="pillar"><strong>Bi-Directional Flow</strong><span>Changes cascade up and down the organization</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="explainer-img">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Blueprint Framework Overview" onclick="openModal(this,'Blueprint Framework — The Foundational Structure')">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- AKAMAI SPOTLIGHT -->
<div class="spotlight">
  <div class="spotlight-inner">
    <h2>Spotlight: Akamai Technologies — A Full Blueprint Suite</h2>
    <p>One of the most comprehensive deployments in our portfolio — five distinct blueprints built for Akamai, each targeting a different strategic lens of the same organization.</p>
    <div class="suite-grid">
      <div class="card" style="background:#0d1b2a; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);">
        <div class="card-img-wrap">
          <img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Akamai Consolidated" onclick="openModal(this,'Akamai – Consolidated Enterprise Blueprint')" style="height:280px;">
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <span class="card-tag" style="background:#1abc9c; color:#0d1b2a;">Master Blueprint</span>
          <h3 style="color:white;">Akamai – Consolidated Enterprise Blueprint</h3>
          <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">The full enterprise view — every function from Sales & Channels to Finance & IT, mapped across all three planning horizons. This serves as the source of truth for all derived blueprints.</p>
          <div class="card-meta">
            <span class="meta-chip" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:#aaa;">Technology</span>
            <span class="meta-chip" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:#aaa;">Enterprise-wide</span>
            <span class="meta-chip" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:#aaa;">7 Functions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="suite-variations">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Akamai Original" onclick="openModal(this,'Akamai – Original Blueprint (v1)')"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="card-tag" style="background:#2e86c1;">Foundation</span>
            <h3>Original Blueprint</h3>
            <p>The foundational version that launched the engagement — establishing the full taxonomy of metrics across Sales, Operations, Marketing, Product, Customer Services, HR, and Finance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Akamai Seller 360" onclick="openModal(this,'Akamai – Seller 360 Blueprint')"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="card-tag" style="background:#8e44ad;">Focused View</span>
            <h3>Seller 360</h3>
            <p>A seller-centric overlay highlighting the metrics and data flows that matter most to the sales organization — volume, cross-sell, competition, and channel performance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Akamai S&OP" onclick="openModal(this,'Akamai – Integrated S&OP Blueprint')"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="card-tag" style="background:#e67e22;">Use-Case Focus</span>
            <h3>Integrated S&OP</h3>
            <p>Highlights the Supply Chain and Operations planning thread, showing how demand signals propagate from Sales through to capacity, cost, and throughput management.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Akamai Workforce" onclick="openModal(this,'Akamai – Workforce / Operational Resource Mgmt Blueprint')"></div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="card-tag" style="background:#27ae60;">Workforce</span>
            <h3>Operational Resource Management</h3>
            <p>Focuses on the HR and workforce planning thread — wages, incentives, turnover — and how headcount drives operational capacity across the enterprise.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FINANCIAL SERVICES -->
<div class="section" style="background:var(--section-bg);">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-icon" style="background:#dbeafe;">🏦</div>
    <div><h2>Financial Services</h2><p>Banking, insurance, and payments — blueprints that integrate regulatory, risk, and customer experience dimensions unique to financial institutions.</p></div>
    <div class="section-count">3 Blueprints</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Bell Bank" onclick="openModal(this,'Bell Bank – Connected Planning Blueprint')"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag" style="background:var(--tag-finance);">Banking</span>
        <h3>Bell Bank – Connected Planning Blueprint</h3>
        <p>A full-enterprise blueprint for a regional bank, spanning Sales, Marketing/Partnerships, Operations/Customer Service, Risk Management, HR, and Finance & IT. Uniquely includes a Risk Management column rarely seen outside financial services — tracking compliance, exposure, and assessment metrics at every planning level.</p>
        <div class="card-meta"><span class="meta-chip">Risk Mgmt Column</span><span class="meta-chip">6 Functions</span><span class="meta-chip">Connected Planning</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Symetra" onclick="openModal(this,'Symetra – Insurance Blueprint')"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag" style="background:var(--tag-finance);">Insurance</span>
        <h3>Symetra – Insurance Blueprint</h3>
        <p>Built for an insurance carrier, this blueprint features industry-specific financial metrics including Embedded Value (EEV), Economic Value Added (EVA), Risk Based Capital Ratio, and Asset-Liability Matching. Functions include Actuary & Risk, Investment, and Claims & Operations — tailored entirely to the insurance operating model.</p>
        <div class="card-meta"><span class="meta-chip">EEV / EVA Metrics</span><span class="meta-chip">Actuarial Functions</span><span class="meta-chip">Industry-Specific</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="VISA Velocity" onclick="openModal(this,'VISA – Velocity Blueprint (Anavate Partners)')"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag" style="background:var(--tag-finance);">Payments</span>
        <h3>VISA – Velocity Blueprint</h3>
        <p>A payments-network blueprint tracking card issuance, merchant network growth, financial institution partnerships, and transaction volume. Spans Sales & Business Development, Services, Development, Operations/Risk & Security, Finance, and HR — reflecting VISA's unique role as a two-sided network platform.</p>
        <div class="card-meta"><span class="meta-chip">Network Metrics</span><span class="meta-chip">Two-Sided Platform</span><span class="meta-chip">7 Functions</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- RETAIL & CONSUMER -->
<div style="background:white; padding-top:4px; padding-bottom:4px;">
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-icon" style="background:#f3e8ff;">🛒</div>
    <div><h2>Retail & Consumer Goods</h2><p>From discount retail to trade promotion — blueprints that connect merchandising, supply chain, store operations, and consumer insights.</p></div>
    <div class="section-count">3 Blueprints</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid wide">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Family Dollar" onclick="openModal(this,'Family Dollar – Next Level Blueprint (2023)')" style="height:230px;"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag" style="background:var(--tag-retail);">Discount Retail</span>
        <h3>Family Dollar – Next Level Blueprint (2023)</h3>
        <p>One of the most detailed retail blueprints in the portfolio. Anchored by 2023 strategic imperatives at the top (Productive Sales Growth, Operating Efficiency, Technology Investment, Culture), it maps seven functions: Supply Chain, Store & Omni-channel, Merchandising, Human Capital, Real Estate, IT, and Finance.</p>
        <div class="card-meta"><span class="meta-chip">Real Estate Column</span><span class="meta-chip">Omni-Channel</span><span class="meta-chip">Imperative-Led</span><span class="meta-chip">7 Functions</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="RGM B2C" onclick="openModal(this,'Revenue Growth Management – B2C Blueprint')" style="height:230px;"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag" style="background:var(--tag-retail);">Consumer Goods – B2C</span>
        <h3>Revenue Growth Management – B2C Blueprint</h3>
        <p>Purpose-built for consumer goods companies managing trade promotion and retail relationships. Functions span Finance, Corporate Marketing, Trade Promotion, Demand & Merchandising, Retailer, and Consumer — simultaneously modeling both the manufacturer's and retailer's perspective.</p>
        <div class="card-meta"><span class="meta-chip">Trade Promotion</span><span class="meta-chip">Retailer + Consumer</span><span class="meta-chip">Dual Perspective</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="RGM B2B" onclick="openModal(this,'Revenue Growth Management – B2B Blueprint')" style="height:230px;"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag" style="background:var(--tag-retail);">Consumer Goods – B2B</span>
        <h3>Revenue Growth Management – B2B Blueprint</h3>
        <p>The B2B counterpart to the B2C RGM blueprint — same structural framework, but metrics reoriented for business customer relationships. Demonstrates how the blueprint architecture flexes across business model variations within the same industry.</p>
        <div class="card-meta"><span class="meta-chip">B2B Metrics</span><span class="meta-chip">Trade & Foodservice</span><span class="meta-chip">RGM Framework</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<!-- TECHNOLOGY -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-icon" style="background:#dcfce7;">💻</div>
    <div><h2>Technology & Semiconductors</h2><p>High-tech companies with complex product, engineering, and customer success functions alongside traditional business operations.</p></div>
    <div class="section-count">4 Blueprints</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-img-wrap"><img class="card-img" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-full="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="GlobalFoundries" onclick="openModal(this,'GlobalFoundries – Blueprint')"></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="card-tag" style="background:var(--tag-tech);">Semiconductors</span>
        <h3>GlobalFoundries – Blueprint</h3>
        <p>Built for one of the world's leading semiconductor foundries. The Manufacturing column features fab-specific metrics: yield, cycle time, capacity, WIP management, and equipment utilization — rarely seen outside the semiconductor vertical.</p>
        <div class="card-meta"><span class="meta-chip">Fab Operations</span><span class="meta-chip">Yield Metrics</span><span class="meta-chip">Supply Chain</span></div>
      </div>
